symbols.purpose:
Act as the debugger callback expected by ``Coordinator``.

``plan`` and ``completed`` are accepted for interface compatibility;
diagnosis uses the latest failure only and does not mutate either.

Frozen metadata with detached, top-level read-only arguments.

Nested dicts/lists remain mutable for tool policy and JSON compatibility;
callers must treat them as read-only after construction.

